,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.4b2 and 4.4b3\n- Not reproductible in 4.4b1 and before\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10400F CPU @ 2.90GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems item texts are trimmed way too much in item lists when a fixed icon size is specified, but actual icon textures are bigger.\n\nHere's how it shows in Material Maker's \"Add node\" popup:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86154c48-ddf2-40b5-9858-9df3f0bcd6f3)\n\nAnd here's how it should look like (and does look like with beta1):\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86120100-907b-49fc-8ec6-93eed973a8f9)\n\nIt seems that enabling the \"same_column_width\" flag workarounds the problem.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nJust open the minimal project in Godot 4.4b3 and the problem is visible in the \"2D\" view.\n\n\n \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug_itemlist.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18718484/bug_itemlist.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.